# High-Level Analysis: Akka Dependencies in OBP-API

## Executive Summary

The OBP-API project has significant Akka usage primarily concentrated in **one main connector type** (`akka_vDec2018`) and supporting infrastructure. Removing Akka dependencies would require a **phased approach** due to the deep integration in the messaging architecture.

